# `device.window_intent`

Focus-vs-spawn decision for opening a window (the shell adaptor executes it).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.space.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `space_id` | `string` |

## Returns

`DeviceWindowIntentResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `decision` | `string` |
| `actor_id` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call device.window_intent --json '{ "space_id": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

